# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# setup: applink
# A program's window shrinks by its grip like a folder's, wherever it
# stands: the shell's frame follows the hand while the program keeps
# painting at its least size, and the desk shows where the frame was.
wait 12
click 980 20
wait 4
menu-pick Programming
wait 4
press 520 134
wait 2
release 520 134
wait 150
expect-title Project
expect-window-at 275 116
note the window carried to the desk's bottom-right corner, then its grip
note dragged inwards: the desk shows where the window was
drag-window Project 560 360
wait 8
expect-window-at 530 350
press 975 672
wait 4
move 900 600
wait 4
move 800 500
wait 4
release 800 500
wait 20
expect-same-as-redraw
expect-pixel 900 600 336698
quit
